## Public ingestion (`AircraftEnquiryPanel`)

Wire to `submitListingEnquiryAction` (or extend `createLeadAction`):

1. `requireAuth()` — guests see sign-in CTA with return URL
2. Resolve listing + seller server-side
3. `findOpenLeadForBuyerListing` OR `createLeadWithInitialMessage`
4. Default type: `GENERAL_ENQUIRY`, source: `PUBLIC_LISTING`
5. Pass `listingId` into panel from buy detail page
6. Post-submit: toast + link to `/dashboard/messages/[leadId]`

Remove guest name/email fields for authenticated users (use session profile).

## Authorization

| Role | Access |
|------|--------|
| Buyer | Own `buyerId` leads only |
| Seller / broker | Leads on own listings |
| Admin | Read on `/dashboard/admin/leads/[leadId]`; admin reply deferred unless requested |

## Recommended build order

Implement in sequence. **Do not skip activity logging or server authorization.**

```text
Phase A — Foundation
  [x] Prisma: LeadMessage + Lead read watermarks (lastMessageAt, sellerLastReadAt, buyerLastReadAt)
  [x] Domain: MESSAGE_SENT + lead-message validators
  [x] Server: lead-messages.ts (create, append, query threads, mark read)
  [x] Tests: auth boundaries, message creates activity, closed lead rejects send

Phase B — Buy page wiring
  [x] submitListingEnquiryAction (server action)
  [x] Wire AircraftEnquiryPanel (auth gate, sonner, thread link)
  [x] Pass listingId from /dashboard/buy/[listingSlug] page

Phase C — Seller Messages inbox
  [x] Replace /dashboard/seller/messages placeholder
  [x] LeadThreadList + LeadThreadView + LeadMessageComposer
  [x] /dashboard/seller/messages/[leadId] deep link
  [x] Unread badge on Messages nav (optional, high value)

Phase D — Buyer Messages
  [x] /dashboard/messages + /dashboard/messages/[leadId]
  [x] Buyer nav entry in navigation.ts
  [x] Role-aware thread header and links

Phase E — CRM integration
  [x] Messages tab/card in LeadWorkspace
  [x] Lead table: last message preview + unread indicator
  [x] Listing workspace Leads & Offers tab links to thread

Phase F — Notifications & polish (defer)
  [ ] NotificationEvent on new message (seller + buyer)
  [ ] Seller dashboard action-required for stale unreplied threads
  [ ] PostHog: MessageSent (after persistence stable)
  [ ] Viewing / document request message templates
```

When the user says **"build lead messaging"**, **"start messaging Phase A"**, or **"wire enquiry panel to CRM"**, begin at the first unchecked phase unless they specify otherwise.

**Smallest vertical slice**: Phase A + B + C — enquiry → DB → seller reply.

## Definition of done

1. Buyer sends message from `/dashboard/buy/[listingSlug]` → persisted `Lead` + `LeadMessage`
2. Seller sees and replies in `/dashboard/seller/messages`
3. Buyer sees reply in `/dashboard/messages`
4. Lead workspace shows same thread; timeline includes `MESSAGE_SENT`
5. Unauthorized users cannot read or post to another party's thread
6. Closed leads: thread visible, composer disabled

